<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26587" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lignĕus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		lignum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of wood, wooden</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ponticulus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 5, 20, 59</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turres,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes. B.
					C. 3, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">materia,</span>”
				<i>wood</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Inv. 2, 57, 170</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					1, 11, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">piscinas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					34, 12, 32, § 123</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Fabii Maximi oppida,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 6, 3, 61</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">custodia,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the stocks</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. 5, 6, 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">salus,</span>”
				<i>written on wooden tablets</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Ps. 1, 1, 45</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Like wood, woody</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">putamen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 22, 24, § 86</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">semen (arboris),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					16, 26, 46, § 110</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Like dry wood, dry</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nervosa et lignea (appellatur) dorcas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					4, 1161</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conjux,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					23, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
